{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1264695-world-of-darkness-secret-world","id":1264695,"title":"World of Darkness: Secret World","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-11-04T23:24:12-08:00","id":1264695,"title":"World of Darkness: Secret World","content":"So I keep thinking, I like the little subsplat level of the World of Darkness. Things like Psychics and Sorcerers and Conspiracies. The Society of Leopold and the Arcanum and Pentex. I feel they are fun for the whole family and could be used for all the Gamelines.<br /> <br /> I would like if they were broadened to be antagonists and NPCs for all the games, much like say if you look into the Werewolf Antagonist section they have foes that are Revenants(risen) and Cyborgs. I like that pulpy fun. I think this would be the Layer to do things like add Ninja clans, and a Worldwide layer of Kill Bill level super assassins, and street fighter esq martial artists. This is somewhat easier with the Merits rules in CoD, but WoD still has the chops!<br /> <br /> I know some think it may detract from some gamelines but that is for each storyteller to adjust. But it\u2019s fun to have things like Assassins who know vaguely the supernatural exist but are open to being hired. Underground fighting rings for entertainment and self improvement, like the secret Arena in Grappler Baki.<br /> <br /> Thoughts? It could be fun to just broaden the Bluebooks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-11-05T1